{
  "description": "<div data-editor-id=\"7700bd09-cfe7-46ad-b8f2-18772abdc8a9\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: inherit\" data-color-scope=\"outer\"><span>This video introduces the nine essential design decisions that shape whether an engagement produces meaningful, legitimate results. Learners will see how each step — from defining goals to designing a project plan — builds on the others, and how AI can enhance each one while keeping human judgment and democratic accountability at the center.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem\"><span style=\"color: rgb(222, 222, 222); text-decoration: inherit\" data-color-scope=\"inner\">Last Updated: July 24, 2026</span></span></p></div>",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "description": "",
      "id": "WtVs-p5FBuszXdBZIFMrYgriqX07yNtx",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "EYFbUz_nfGNMrlhD6pX2UXm3vBWZ--5s",
